============================================================

### Ex::Drop ###
	Index      Drop tier id (arbitrary, just a grouping key).
	DropRate   Chance this tier rolls at all, out of 10000.

### Ex::Drop::Class ###
	Section         Which <Pool> to roll an item from if this tier hits.
	Rate            Weight of this class-row among the Drop's <Class> rows.
	Money           Zen dropped instead, if no item pool match.
	Option          Bit 1 = fireworks on drop, bit 2 = party-wide class check.
	DW/DK/FE/MG/DL/SU/RF   Which classes (and reset-tier, per class) may
	                       receive this drop, 0 = never.

### Ex::Pool::Item ###
	Index      Raw combined item code (GET_ITEM(Type,Index) already
	           combined) - taken from the reference as-is, unverified
	           against this project's own Item.xml.
	Level/Grade/Option0-6   Random item level/option rolls.
	Duration   Seconds until the item expires, 0 = permanent.

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

<ItemBag UseEx="1">
	<Ex>
		<Drop Index="0" DropRate="10000">
			<Class Section="5" Rate="10000" Money="0" Option="0" DW="1" DK="1" FE="1" MG="1" DL="1" SU="1" RF="1" />
		</Drop>
		<Pool Section="5">
			<Item Index="10" Level="0" Grade="0" Option0="-1" Option1="-1" Option2="-1" Option3="-1" Option4="-1" Option5="-1" Option6="-1" Duration="0" Comment="Lucky Bag Egg (reference comment, unverified)" />
		</Pool>
	</Ex>
</ItemBag>
